{"title": "Lava", "pageid": 6205, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Lava", "categories": ["Surfaces", "Areas"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"min-height: 200px\" class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Lava_surface.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/Lava_surface.png/300px-Lava_surface.png.webp, /w/images/e/ee/Lava_surface.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Lava image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/Lava_surface.png/300px-Lava_surface.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ee/Lava_surface.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Lava</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Area\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">area</a>. Characters passing through lava are slowed and receive massive fire damage per turn.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">10d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage per turn.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/38px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Type: <a href=\"/wiki/Area#Surface\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">Surface</a></dd>\n\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Melting\"> Condition: Melting </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Melting_(Condition)\" title=\"Melting (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Melting_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Melting_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Melting_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Melting_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Melting_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Melting_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Melting\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Melting_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Melting_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Melting_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Melting_(Condition)\" title=\"Melting (Condition)\">Melting</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Whilst on surface</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">10d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage per turn.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Difficult_Terrain:_Lava\"> Condition: Difficult Terrain: Lava </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain:_Lava_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain: Lava (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Difficult Terrain: Lava\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain:_Lava_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain: Lava (Condition)\">Difficult Terrain: Lava</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Whilst on surface</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Movement speed</a> halved.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creation\">Creation</span></h2>\n<p>This area can be created by the following:\n</p><p>\nSpells and actions:\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Create_Lava\" title=\"Create Lava\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Create_Lava_Icon.webp/30px-Create_Lava_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Create_Lava_Icon.webp/45px-Create_Lava_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Create_Lava_Icon.webp/60px-Create_Lava_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Create Lava\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Create_Lava_Icon.webp/30px-Create_Lava_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Create_Lava_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Create_Lava\" title=\"Create Lava\">Create Lava</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>NPCs that die from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Melting_(Condition)\" title=\"Melting (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Melting_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Melting_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Melting_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Melting_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Melting_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Melting_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Melting\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Melting_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Melting_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Melting_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Melting_(Condition)\" title=\"Melting (Condition)\">Melting</a> <i>burn to ash</i> and:\n<ul><li>can no longer be targeted by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Dead\" title=\"Speak with Dead\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/20px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/30px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/40px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Speak with Dead\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/20px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Dead\" title=\"Speak with Dead\">Speak with Dead</a></li>\n<li>gain a charred appearance offset with patches of glowing orange when inspected</li>\n<li>may lose certain items\n<ul><li>Most notably <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nere%27s_Head\" title=\"Nere's Head\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9c/Nere%27s_Head_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Nere%27s_Head_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9c/Nere%27s_Head_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Nere%27s_Head_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9c/Nere%27s_Head_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Nere%27s_Head_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9c/Nere%27s_Head_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Nere%27s_Head_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9c/Nere%27s_Head_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nere%27s_Head\" title=\"Nere's Head\">Nere's Head</a> becomes unavailable if he burns to ash by melting, failing <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deliver_Nere%27s_Head\" title=\"Deliver Nere's Head\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deliver Nere's Head\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Deliver_Nere%27s_Head\" title=\"Deliver Nere's Head\">Deliver Nere's Head</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li>Characters do not burn to ash if they:\n<ul><li>are a party member</li>\n<li>die from damage other than <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">fire</span></a> while standing in lava</li>\n<li>are displaced into lava through certain mechanisms and die immediately from the damage taken (i.e. on the displacer's turn). The key factor appears to be that \"killed while downed\" overrides burning to ash. A non-exhaustive list includes:\n<ul><li>being <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/30px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/40px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thrown\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Thrown</a> <b>does not</b> trigger burning to ash. Neither does <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Telekinesis\" title=\"Telekinesis\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp/20px-Telekinesis_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp/30px-Telekinesis_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp/40px-Telekinesis_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Telekinesis\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp/20px-Telekinesis_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Telekinesis\" title=\"Telekinesis\">Telekinesis</a>.</li>\n<li>being <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shove\" title=\"Shove\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/20px-Shove_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/30px-Shove_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/40px-Shove_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shoved\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/20px-Shove_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shove\" title=\"Shove\">Shoved</a> <b>does</b> trigger burning to ash, as do <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boot_of_the_Giants\" title=\"Boot of the Giants\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Boot_of_the_Giants_Icon.webp/20px-Boot_of_the_Giants_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Boot_of_the_Giants_Icon.webp/30px-Boot_of_the_Giants_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Boot_of_the_Giants_Icon.webp/40px-Boot_of_the_Giants_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Boot of the Giants\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Boot_of_the_Giants_Icon.webp/20px-Boot_of_the_Giants_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/Boot_of_the_Giants_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Boot_of_the_Giants\" title=\"Boot of the Giants\">Boot of the Giants</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mobile_Flourish_(Ranged)\" title=\"Mobile Flourish (Ranged)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp/20px-Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp/30px-Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp/40px-Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mobile Flourish (Ranged)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp/20px-Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mobile_Flourish_(Ranged)\" title=\"Mobile Flourish (Ranged)\">Mobile Flourish (Ranged)</a></li>\n<li>displacement methods that would otherwise trigger burning to ash do not do so if the target is already <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">Prone</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714205836\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.094 seconds\nReal time usage: 